Usage: agent-deck remote list [options]

Options:
  --check
        Ask each remote for its agent-deck version and update timer now (two SSH calls per remote)
  --retry
        Clear cached poll/authentication state for all configured remotes (no SSH unless --check)
  --owner <name>
        Show only sandboxes owned by <name>; "me" is this machine's [sandbox] owner (default $USER)
  --json
        Output as JSON
